  "releaseNotes": "2.0.3 -- Fix: Profile.Tree.FindFolderByName searches the whole tree (it stopped after the first subtree). 2.0.1: new optional tooltip-text-align attribute (left / center / right) on table fields and form cells -- Table.Properties.TooltipTextAlign and Form.Properties.TooltipTextAlign. 2.0.0 (BREAKING, major release for nuget.org): PostgreSQL support added across WA.Core -- the same config XML / SQL now runs on SQL Server or PostgreSQL (Npgsql). All SI.WA.* packages moved to a new major version together; reference them with matching versions.",
